 of inspiration or a deep dive into artistic expression, Reizor offers a unique platform that combines simplicity with innovation. Join us in this artistic journey and see the world through a new lens!", "short_description": "Discover and explore a curated collection of artists featuring their galleries, captivating images, videos, and stunning 360-degree experiences in Reizor."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://reizor.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RZR Music LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://reizor.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7691539774281002"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "838453928443930"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "838453928443930"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1728027360, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "838453928443930"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "7792013994233579", "version": "1.2.0"}, "id": "536349785433745", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7644468475654799", "is